OL,3,GNEWSAWarning to owners after boat sinks
OL,4,Ain marina
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoat owners have been warned to check
OL,7,Fon their vessels before and after bad
OL,8,Fweather, particularly during the winter
OL,9,Fmonths.
OL,11,FKieran Higgs, Guernsey Ports' head of
OL,12,Fport operations, issued the warning
OL,13,Fafter harbour dive teams helped recover
OL,14,Fa vessel which sank on its mooring in
OL,15,Fthe QEII Marina in St Peter Port.
OL,17,FThe dive team and the Sarnia workboat
OL,18,Fcrew, which look after the island's
OL,19,Fharbours, used inflatable lifting bags
OL,20,Fto refloat and tow the Pirate 21 which
OL,21,Fhad taken on water and become partially
OL,22,Fsubmerged earlier this week.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
